      "id": "O01",
      "verdict": "confirmed",
      "reason": "Do lets the panic propagate and marks the Once done during unwinding. TestOncePanicDone checks that the caller recovers the original panic value and that a later Do returns without invoking its function.",
      "line": 77,
      "fragment": "defer o.done.Store(true)"
